        "created_at": "2015-09-16T14:10:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just had a fun cheap victory myself.</p><p>While fighting Apostate in Silver Gulch, an Explosives Wagon came into play.&nbsp; Visionary put Wrest the Mind on the Wagon and then went into her Cocoon.&nbsp; Before I had a chance to set the Wagon off though, a 2nd one came into play.&nbsp; When it came back around to the Heroes turn, I blew up one of wagons.&nbsp; There were 5 heroes, a couple of other environment targets, a couple of villain targets, and a few Bots in play so I had a something like 30 separate instances of 4 damage to redirect at will.&nbsp; BOOM!&nbsp; I never even got to the the 2nd wagon going off as Apostate didn't survive all of the damage I redirected from the first wagon.</p><p>I love when Visionary gets scary like that.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
