        "username": "VisforYoshi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-16T14:57:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a really good game against Akash'Bhutaa that was Visionary, Mr.Fixer, and Absolute Zero in Megalopolis. By the second round I had twist the ether on AZ (with an isothermic and null-point), Mr Fixer had dual crowbars and grease monkey fist, and visionary had a TTE on AZ. All I had to do to kill any of the limbs was use Mr. Fixer to bounce some fire damage odd of AZ, and then hit the limb. And At the end, I looped a TTE on AZ until he took about 50 Fire damage in the total round, and nuked Akash for game. It was probably one of the most one sided fights I've had as of late</p>",
