      {
        "id": 145603,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-04T01:38:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fun one, Voss vs. Greatest Legacy, Haka, and Visionary in Realm of Discord. Savage Mana ate minions; Gung Ho into Mental Divergence killed all three Forced Deployments early enough that Haka could eat whoever he missed the first time around. Fortitude and Lead from the Front kept Voss himself from doing anything but plink Greatest Legacy, who then healed up with Motivational Charge anyway. The warships never showed up, but Visionary had Wrest the Mind in hand and put a Twist the Ether on Haka just in case. Three Dominions + Distortions breaking each other every couple rounds put about 25 cards in Haka's hand.</p><p>Finally, with Voss sitting at about 40 HP, Ethereal Bonds hits Haka while Time Flies is out, so I use Haka of Battle and toss in all but his other two Hakas of Battle. Environment plays the exploding bubbles, which Legacy kills (along with the minions Voss played on his turn) with Flying Smash -- earning Haka three more cards. Blow the other two Hakas of Battle, then kill Voss with a 50 HP Savage Mana.</p><p>I'd never beaten Voss before with everyone at such high HP -- nobody ever dipped below 20 and everyone was over 25 at the end.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
